# BIBO terms the Martialis ontology uses (Source is a bibo:Document; volume,
# issue and pages are slot IRIs; peerReview, callNumber, doi, pmid, oclc and handle specialize
# BIBO properties). `make imports` extracts a STAR module of
# ontology/imports/bibo.rdf for exactly these.
http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Document
http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/status
http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/locator
http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/doi
http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/volume
http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/issue
http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/pages
http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/pmid
http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/oclcnum
http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/handle
